14
00:00:14,102 --> 00:00:15,702
Direction la France, en

15
00:00:15,722 --> 00:00:15,702
mille huit cent

16
00:00:15,722 --> 00:00:17,748
quatre-vingt-quinze.

17
00:00:18,097 --> 00:00:18,697
Un médecin, Gustave Le

18
00:00:18,717 --> 00:00:18,697
Bon, publie un livre

19
00:00:18,717 --> 00:00:21,757
: la psychologie des

20
00:00:21,777 --> 00:00:22,762
